godot/issues/comments/5048288393","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120709#issuecomment-5048288393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120709","id":5048288393,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLObEiQ","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T15:45:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T15:45:37Z","body":"This setting can can be a source of confusion and time wasting, as users might (among other things) forget they had it enabled. I think this option should always print or show a warning toast when playing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5048288393/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5765928755","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120709#issuecomment-5765928755","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120709","id":5765928755,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABV60XMw","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-21T19:03:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T19:03:19Z","body":"I also think this setting can be a source of confusion and time wasting. MSBuild already performs incremental builds by default, so no-change builds should be pretty fast. Also, the [MSBuild server](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/whats-new/dotnet-11/sdk#msbuild-server-enabled-by-default) will be enabled by default in .NET 11, which should speed up repeated builds even more.\r\n\r\nIf there's something we're doing that's slowing down the build, it's likely https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123668, so I'd prefer to fix that instead of providing a setting for users to shoot themselves in the foot with.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5765928755/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5766081837","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120709#issuecomment-5766081837","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120709","id":5766081837,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABV69tLQ","user":{"login":"MKadirYilmaz","id":170586875,"node_id":"U_kgDOCiry-w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170586875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MKadirYilmaz","html_url":"https://github.com/MKadirYilmaz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MKadirYilmaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MKadirYilmaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MKadirYilmaz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MKadirYilmaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MKadirYilmaz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MKadirYilmaz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MKadirYilmaz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MKadirYilmaz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MKadirYilmaz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-21T19:15:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T19:15:12Z","body":"> I also think this setting can be a source of confusion and time wasting. MSBuild already performs incremental builds by default, so no-change builds should be pretty fast. Also, the [MSBuild server](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/whats-new/dotnet-11/sdk#msbuild-server-enabled-by-default) will be enabled by default in .NET 11, which should speed up repeated builds even more.\r\n> \r\n> If there's something we're doing that's slowing down the build, it's likely #123668, so I'd prefer to fix that instead of providing a setting for users to shoot themselves in the foot with.\r\n\r\nI completely understand the concern. That said, this is a standard setting in most other game engines, and it’s something I rely on quite heavily in my own workflow. That’s why I noticed its absence right away and wanted to share it with the community—I think others who use it as often as I do would find it really helpful.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5766081837/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5773178440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120709#issuecomment-5773178440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120709","id":5773178440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWBu2SA","user":{"login":"MDeero","id":63310054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMzEwMDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63310054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDeero","html_url":"https://github.com/MDeero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDeero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDeero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDeero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDeero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDeero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDeero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDeero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDeero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDeero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T08:07:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T15:13:08Z","body":"> I also think this setting can be a source of confusion and time wasting. MSBuild already performs incremental builds by default, so no-change builds should be pretty fast. Also, the [MSBuild server](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/whats-new/dotnet-11/sdk#msbuild-server-enabled-by-default) will be enabled by default in .NET 11, which should speed up repeated builds even more.\r\n> \r\n> If there's something we're doing that's slowing down the build, it's likely #123668, so I'd prefer to fix that instead of providing a setting for users to shoot themselves in the foot with.\r\n\r\nA \"fix\" would be nice,\r\n~~but maybe a temporary solution is faster.~~\r\n~~An option to skip build and a button to reload DLLs would be a good option imo.~~\r\n~~Then C# could be developed in the external editor with all the build tools these provide and where i believe most ppl do their C# work anyways.~~\r\nAnd this #123739 would be it. Nice and fast.\r\nAs to the topic of building outside of the godot editor:\r\nIt seems with the correct setup (Debug setup in external editors) an external build is possible. So in godot editor the option of not building or reloading DLLs on demand, doesn't really seem necessary.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5773178440/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]